WEBVTT

00:00:01.509 --> 00:00:07.210
Filter Interactions to appeals waiting for review

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:11.176
Open the call and click Start review to claim it

00:00:11.176 --> 00:00:19.098
Rate each disputed parameter and add a remark

00:00:19.098 --> 00:00:24.643
Keep the AI's ratings for everything nobody disputed

00:00:24.643 --> 00:00:33.522
Resolve the appeal. Its score becomes the call's score.
